<http://data.silknow.org/object/d86ac248-df76-35ad-afec-3bde0e02b05e/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Doll, carved wood with gesso and paint, inset glass lozenge eyes. Human hair wig with hair ornament of black silk ribbon. Wearing a green silk open robe over a green petticoat, pink silk pincushion suspended from waist by a cord girdle. Under the robe and petticoat are cotton stays and a quilted petticoat, an embroidered pocket, another petticoat with a printed cotton border, and two chemises. She wears pink knitted silk stockings with blue ribbon garters and shoes of leather & silk with silver braid trimming."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/d86ac248-df76-35ad-afec-3bde0e02b05e> .

